        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of cut voided silk velvet, satin ground.\nThe left hand edge is irregular.\nStriped velvet: yellow, bright pink, dull pink and white satin ground with a pattern of green velvet stems and flowers in yellow, pink, red and white. \nThe stems are vertical and slightly undulating and each goes over two adjacent stripes."@en ;
